.TH CRUNCH_KEXEC_LOAD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_kexec_load \- Linux x86-64 syscall 246
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B long crunch_kexec_load(unsigned long entry, unsigned long count, const void* segments, unsigned long flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Loads a kernel image; this privileged operation can alter system boot state.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kexec_load (2)
